{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/480785-confidante-and-two-step-blood-bonds","id":480785,"title":"Confidante and two step blood bonds","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-14T15:20:21-07:00","id":480785,"title":"Confidante and two step blood bonds","content":"Confidante states that those under its affects want to do just about anything for you, short of death and taking a breaking point. If the target with the Charmed condition is a vampire, would telling them to take a one, or two, step blood bond negate its effects and drop the Charmed condition or just allow the vampire to reject it? What about if you tried a full vinculum? Majesty is also meant to smooth over what a person did under its effects, making it seem like less of a bad idea in terms of post-justifying it and with a potential blood bond still in place.... I imagine a vampire could still reflexively resist the blood bond despite Confidante, however.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My horror roleplaying blog with a strong focus on World of Darkness and Call of Cthulhu can be found here: <a href=\"http://stwildonroleplaying.blogspot.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\">http://stwildonroleplaying.blogspot.com.au/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1248-laraqua","name":"Laraqua","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T08:14:21-07:00","id":481316,"title":"","content":"This is my opinion here, but I dont see why Confidante wouldnt allow for that. First if the victim of majesty isnt a vampire they would have no idea what drinking your blood would do to them so they would just think you are a freak. Not a breaking point. Second if they were a vampire, then with Majesty they wouldnt want to upset you so why would they say no? It's not physically going to get them killed or hurt them, they are just going to love you a little more permanently. They would still get the roll to resist the bond. <br /> <br /> OR! just fill your mouth with vitae and tell them to kiss you forcing them to take the vitae anyway ( it says in the book Daeva like to do that ) &quot;Kiss me&quot; is a far less of a threatening command than &quot;take a blood bond with me&quot;<br /> <br /> Just be aware that in the FAQ or another thread in here somewhere it says you can only get 1 stage of blood bond per night.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T09:06:52-07:00","id":481354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vitalis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/480785-confidante-and-two-step-blood-bonds?p=481316#post481316\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just be aware that in the FAQ or another thread in here somewhere it says you can only get 1 stage of blood bond per night.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless you're a Voivode... awyisssss.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}